# Three Settings panes, every one readable: Edit, the tallest, on the left;
# Themes above General on the right, General in front.
# expect: General, Themes, Edit
# Settings labels are 13 pt and cannot zoom; three panes fit at about 0.95×.
# legible: 24
# combine: 8c-settings-edit 8b-settings-themes 8a-settings-general
